{
	"Name": "ScheduledSearch - Okta - Workflows - Okta Workflow Created, Modified or Exported",
	"Description": "An Okta Workflow, folder, or connection was created, modified, imported, or exported. Workflows run with their connection's authority and can call any API they are connected to, so a new or edited flow is code execution inside your identity provider. Exports also carry the flow's data out of Okta.\n\nEvent types: workflows.user.flow.create, workflows.user.flow.activate, workflows.user.flow.import, workflows.user.flow.export, workflows.user.connection.create, workflows.user.folder.import, workflows.user.folder.export\n\nReference(s):\n- https://help.okta.com/en-us/content/topics/workflows/workflows-main.htm\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n\nThis scheduled search is a dispatcher on \"Alert - Okta - Alert Router\". Its name is what appears as the alert name, so rename it here if you want the alerts named differently.\n\nIt ships disabled; enable it once you have reviewed the query and are happy with the volume it produces.",
	"Labels": [
		"okta"
	],
